## Story Description
The upload flow collects a user-defined column_mapping dict (e.g. {'Invoice Date': 'invoice_date', 'Supplier Name': 'raw_supplier_name'}) in the RunRequest body. _run_pipeline() in backend/app/routers/ingestion.py already receives column_mapping as a parameter (it is the 4th positional arg, passed from background_tasks.add_task at line 100-102). However, the call to ingestor.ingest_to_raw() at approximately line 283 does not forward it: it passes source_system=None only. Ingestor.ingest_to_raw() in src/ingestion/ingest.py at line 157 needs a new column_mapping: dict | None = None keyword argument. When provided, inject as self.mapper.mappings['__ADHOC__'] = column_mapping and set source_system = '__ADHOC__' so that ingest_file() uses the user-provided mapping. The source_row_hash is computed from raw_row_dicts (the raw CSV before mapping) so hashes are unaffected by this change.

## Acceptance Criteria
- Edit file: src/ingestion/ingest.py — change the signature of ingest_to_raw() from (self, file_path: str, engine, engagement_id: str, source_system: str = None) to (self, file_path: str, engine, engagement_id: str, source_system: str = None, column_mapping: dict | None = None)
- Edit file: src/ingestion/ingest.py — inside ingest_to_raw(), after the line 'batch_id = create_batch(...)' and before the call to 'self.ingest_file(file_path, source_system)', add: if column_mapping: self.mapper.mappings['__ADHOC__'] = column_mapping; source_system = '__ADHOC__'
- Edit file: backend/app/routers/ingestion.py — in _run_pipeline(), find the call to ingestor.ingest_to_raw() (it passes file_path, src_engine, engagement_id, source_system=None) and add column_mapping=column_mapping as an additional keyword argument. The column_mapping variable is already in scope as a parameter of _run_pipeline().
- Run: cd backend && python -m pytest tests/ -v — all existing tests must pass. The existing call signature ingest_to_raw(file_path, engine, engagement_id, source_system=None) is unchanged (column_mapping defaults to None).
- Verify: in src/ingestion/ingest.py, the if column_mapping: block appears before the self.ingest_file() call so that the __ADHOC__ mapping is set before column mapping is applied

